{"data":{"body":"[P2] Preserve invoke start details when applying terminal events\n\nReplacing the operation for a terminal chained-invoke event rebuilds `ChainedInvokeDetails` using only the terminal result/error, discarding the `functionName` and `tenantId` captured from `CHAINED_INVOKE_STARTED`. Completed `TestOperation`s consequently expose null target metadata. Merge the terminal fields into the existing started operation and add assertions for the retained metadata.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7okCEV","finding_digest":"851a450546eae732d61e1a318f37a70c47b0692733b70838e5c725822e3e8d85","finding_id":"arf_v1_qunekbkg5lttfvq6diyy6n5hbr","finding_key":"sdk-testing/history-event-processor::process-events::preserve-chained-invoke-start-metadata","identity_key":"sdk-testing/history-event-processor::process-events::preserve-chained-invoke-start-metadata","line":277,"observation_digest":"2c90f51dfee7fdb1ee408eb2fb85f6e27c123218166e7774d6deeda126b564c9","observation_id":"aro_v1_fsipkhp64763d3sar2zpxbpw4j","path":"sdk-testing/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/testing/cloud/HistoryEventProcessor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T07:29:29Z","review_id":"arr_v1_wbpcd537x2snttz7xawbvl5n6j","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"d3eaf0fc72800288b6d1abe617884f39baa4aa9d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":277,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":648},"record_id":"art_v1_yx2lj3mcrus2tfbuf53ilzwz3l","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T07:29:29Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
